      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要是感受着奇怪的重压，\n是跑不好比赛的吧。\n我带着温热饮品，来到准备室——",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f44db3b9a7d5ceb2b19330f5976dcbd8a18ee7b3b935eba004b58a0214609d1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
