    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:630620a0865ad41e1487f283",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我四处搜寻，终于找到了\n真弓快车，\n她已经换好衣服在地下通道里了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d07a9e7090d0c059c805bb56179d7c0b5ec8a009f39c16281cdd64a0ec9ddd8c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
