      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "果然还是真弓快车吧？\n她的出道战我看了，很强哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea25f7d8e4e5bec420cb7f70e1b6dee22f1ea64beda435fa3c05a7b904400c9d",
